      "body": "German has two ways to say 'you':\n\n- **du** (informal): Friends, family, fellow students (Nepali: तिमी).\n- **Sie** (formal): Strangers, elders, officials (Nepali: तपाईं).\n\nQuestions:\n- **Wie heißt du?** (Informal)\n- **Wie heißen Sie?** (Formal)"
